Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 00:28:46 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] build: record Bluetooth APEX LHDC dependencies

Record the new LHDC and libstdc++ APEX dependencies used by the software
codec integration. Nov 13 Bluetooth APEX and IMG build passed. Source
provenance and companion revisions are recorded in the project LHDC ledger.

Recorded before the LineageOS 24.0 migration. See the project integration
record bringup/phase-b/LINEAGE_24_MIGRATION_20261114.zh-CN.md for companion
repository revisions and validation boundaries.

Change-Id: Ia6fe8a8be4ef709ca06be6d34a52ab0a025908e8
